{"sessionId":"L1-S07","number":7,"sessionTitle":"Step by Step","title":"Bolt and the Map","titleCard":{"text":"Episode 7. Bolt and the Map.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S07/title.ogg","dur":2.999,"env":"000svk08umqojtrsj2bmoktvr42pqqpm60000000000jzyxxttsqg22b6408oqqpm832psvwqssomlic0030000000","words":[["Episode",0.1,0.85],["7.",0.85,1.07],["Bolt",1.45,1.83],["and",1.83,2.14],["the",2.14,2.44],["Map.",2.44,2.75]],"voice":"narrator"},"previously":{"text":"Three lights found. Bolt ran off with Nana’s map…","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S07/prev.ogg","dur":4.954,"env":"000tzzytmdjh2fc0ieuuusrrstrtrn600000000003giezzzzyxzxxxso42fnoh33vwwusvuuqttlb700000000003yvtm90d4dvzwwwsuvvsh6734wxb3syyywxxqnuqgdmwtqoljf0040000000","words":[["Last",0.1,0.55],["time...",0.55,1.01],["Three",1.39,1.78],["lights",1.78,2.23],["found.",2.23,2.62],["Bolt",2.99,3.29],["ran",3.29,3.54],["off",3.54,3.79],["with",3.79,4.1],["Nana’s",4.1,4.46],["map…",4.46,4.71]],"voice":"narrator"},"scenes":[{"setting":"Lantern Hill market: stripy stalls of fruit, cloth, pots and spices; narrow lanes between them.","action":"Bolt dashes between stalls with the map in his mouth. The team chases him and loses him in the lanes.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":0,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"Bolt! Where did he go?","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S07/0.ogg","dur":2.385,"env":"000000000kyzzzxc0000000300000000000000000gzzslvtqizxvtwwvxsoife400000000","words":[["Bolt!",0.06,0.86],["Where",1.25,1.58],["did",1.58,1.8],["he",1.8,1.98],["go?",1.98,2.16]],"voice":"amara"},{"i":1,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"These lanes are like a maze!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S07/1.ogg","dur":2.178,"env":"03azxspquzror7ozzxmkmijctrwoopmqxwo87hkgfgqsutqqmjhebippf320000000","words":[["These",0.07,0.47],["lanes",0.47,0.86],["are",0.86,1.14],["like",1.14,1.48],["a",1.48,1.63],["maze!",1.63,1.96]],"voice":"spark"}]},{"setting":"Ms Mei’s fruit stall. Bolt sits proudly, the map at his feet, a mango on his head.","action":"Ms Mei waves from the far corner of the market.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":2,"who":"guest","guestName":"Ms Mei, the fruit seller","text":"Your puppy is here! Come round the back of the cloth stall!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S07/2.ogg","dur":3.825,"env":"0000000002xzh0buzp0txzzzd8bjzvrjjg5000000000000000000000008otpuuwvtplqer70iqrj808ue209748buwrf4592bxoolf80000000000","words":[["Your",0.06,0.34],["puppy",0.34,0.68],["is",0.68,0.86],["here!",0.86,1.14],["Come",1.93,2.13],["round",2.13,2.36],["the",2.36,2.53],["back",2.53,2.73],["of",2.73,2.85],["the",2.85,3.02],["cloth",3.02,3.25],["stall!",3.25,3.49]],"voice":"mei"},{"i":3,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"If we just go, we’ll get lost. Let’s plan the whole way first.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S07/3.ogg","dur":5.282,"env":"06zb795jtqa420fryqdlnh5c00lzzzzxniif3000000000000htrrne37rzzd68owyvspha47bkmj28000000005ivzp7csna267vpnmkjkfea2000000009vl76kzyxvsmmvuql9544lsoja59ilk460000000","words":[["If",0.06,0.35],["we",0.35,0.64],["just",0.64,1.09],["go,",1.09,1.37],["we’ll",1.37,1.82],["get",1.82,2.19],["lost.",2.19,2.64],["Let’s",2.94,3.29],["plan",3.29,3.65],["the",3.65,3.94],["whole",3.94,4.36],["way",4.36,4.65],["first.",4.65,5.08]],"voice":"spark"}]},{"setting":"Spark projects a glowing grid map of the market in the air.","action":"Amara puts arrow stickers on the map: turn, go 2, turn, go 3. Spark traces it with a dotted line.","seconds":45,"lines":[{"i":4,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"A plan with steps in order has a special name. An algorithm.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S07/4.ogg","dur":5.254,"env":"008q200d87iusppnmmmlmmlic20kp3astvu3jutqe07vsmkqqp900frsrsljqpnojqrirditsvto2axpirqfrtopsrttrrqppplmkjg50000000000000hsqqk8astvxtqqj7kwtttold27onlhhggg7000000","words":[["A",0.1,0.27],["plan",0.27,0.63],["with",0.63,0.99],["steps",0.99,1.41],["in",1.41,1.64],["order",1.64,2.07],["has",2.07,2.36],["a",2.36,2.52],["special",2.52,3.08],["n